# Generated outputs — nothing under supplement/ is tracked. The sweep
# shards, aggregate CSVs, tables, and manuscript figures are all
# regenerable from scripts/run_batch_sweep.py + scripts/aggregate_results.py
# + scripts/aggregate_per_locus_for_A.py + scripts/build_manuscript_figures.py.
# The tracked copies of the paper figures live in the companion nwflex_TNG
# repo under tex/, next to main.tex.

